<html ><head ><meta charset="UTF-8"  /><meta name="author" content="Martin Walther - @tinuwalther"  /><meta name="keywords" content="Pode, PSHTML, PowerShell, Mermaid Diagram"  /><meta name="description" content="Builds beatuifull HTML-Files with PSHTML from native PowerShell-Scripts"  /><link href="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"  /><link href="\assets\style\style.css" rel="stylesheet"  /><script src="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.bundle.min.js"  ></script><script src="\assets\Chartjs\Chart.bundle.min.js"  ></script><title >#PSXi </title><link href="/assets/img/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/x-icon"  /></head><Body ><header ><div Class="jumbotron text-center" Id="j1" Style="padding:15; background-color:#012456"  ><p ><h1 >#PSXi Help</h1></p><p >I ♥ PS Pode > This is an example for using pode and PSHTML, requested by API. The page is 
$(if(Test-Path 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Help.pode'){
    $($regex = '[0-9]{4}\-[0-9]{2}\-[0-9]{2}\s[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}')
    $($index = Get-Content 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Help.pode')
    $($created = Get-Date ([regex]::Match($index, $regex).Value))
    $($diffTime = New-TimeSpan -Start $created -End (Get-Date))
    $(if($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 60 -and $diffTime.TotalMinutes -lt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-warning' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-warning' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }elseif($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-danger' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-danger' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }else{
        # $badge = 'badge badge-success' # Bootstrap v4.6.x 
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-success' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    })
    $(span -class $badge {'{0} Days {1} Hours {2} Minutes' -f $diffTime.Days, $diffTime.Hours, $diffTime.Minutes})
})
 old.</p></div></header><Section Id="section"  ><nav Class="navbar navbar-expand-sm bg-dark navbar-dark sticky-top"  ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><a Target="_self" Class="navbar-brand" href="/"  >»HOME</a><button Class="navbar-toggler" data-bs-target="#collapsibleNavbar" data-bs-toggle="collapse" type="button"  ><span Class="navbar-toggler-icon"  ></span></button><div Class="collapse navbar-collapse" Id="collapsibleNavbar"  ><ul Class="navbar-nav"  ><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="#RebuildByFW"  >Re-build by FileWatcher</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="#RebuildByAPI"  >Re-build by API</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="/help"  >Help</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><div Class="Container" Id="Content"  ><article Id="Pode"  ><h1 Style="color:#212529"  >Re-build pages</h1><h2 Id="RebuildByFW" Style="color:#212529"  >Re-build by FileWatcher</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-build by FileWatcher is not supported on a Container!</p><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Index.pode page:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >New-Item ./PodePSHTML/upload -Force -Name index.txt</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Pode-Server.pode page:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >New-Item ./PodePSHTML/upload -Force -Name pode.txt</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Update-Assets.pode page:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >New-Item ./PodePSHTML/upload -Force -Name asset.txt</pre><h2 Id="RebuildByAPI" Style="color:#212529"  >Re-build by API</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Index.pode page:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/index -Method Post</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Pode-Server.pode page:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/pode -Method Post</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Update-Assets.pode page:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/asset -Method Post</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the SQLite-Data.pode page with own sql query:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/sqlite -Method Post -Body 'SELECT * FROM "classic_ESXiHosts" Limit 7'</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Pester-Result.pode page with own destinations to test:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/pester -Method Post -Body '["sbb.ch","admin.ch"]'</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Mermaid-Diagram.pode page:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/mermaid -Method Post -Body 'SELECT * FROM "classic_ESXiHosts" ORDER BY HostName'</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the Help.pode page:</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/help -Method Post</pre></article></div></Section><pre Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the page: I ♥ PS > Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/help -Method Post</pre></Body><div Class="container-fluid" Style="background-color:#343a40"  ><footer ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><div Class="row align-items-center"  ><div Class="col-md"  ><p ><a Target="_self" Class="btn-sm btn btn-outline-success" href="#"  >I ♥ PS ></a></p></div><div Class="col-md"  ><p ><a Target="_blank" href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Pode"  >pode</a> and <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/PSHTML"  >PSHTML</a></p></div><div Class="col-md" Style="color:#000"  ><p >Created at 2024-08-18 12:40:26</p></div></div></div></footer></div></html>
